Selected Idea
-------------

Introduce Nuëyon as an AI‑first company with Nuëyon.Compose as its concrete first step
Present Nuëyon’s core identity and immediate direction: an AI‑first company building reusable, AI‑native products for other AI‑first businesses, with Nuëyon.Compose as the first concrete product that puts the company’s principles into practice without overstating implementation or commercial status.

